<title>USA: National-Oilwell, Dreco merger oked.</title>
<headline>National-Oilwell, Dreco merger oked.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>National-Oilwell Inc and Dreco Energy Services Ltd said Wednesday the waiting period for their previously announced merger was ended early, and  it expects the deal to close by the end of August.</p>
<p>National-Oilwell in May announced the merger, and said it would close in the third quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>National-Oilwell makes and sells machines and equipment used in oil and gas drilling and production.</p>
<p>Dreco, based in Edmonton, Alberta, Canada, designs and makes drilling equipment.</p>
</text>
